          "attributedTo": "https://lemmy2.local/u/Theprogressivist",
          "audience": "https://lemmy2.local/c/pics",
          "cc": [],
          "content": "<p>We have been seeing a big influx of memes and non Pic posts. This is a reminder that this community is meant for Pics which is just that -  pictures taken with a camera. Any non Pic posts will be taken down and frequent infracture of that rule will lead to a temp ban.</p>\n<p>We have also been seeing an uptick on Violent posts and manifestos. This is not the community for this type of post. No violent, NSFW posts are allowed. These will lead to an immediate temp ban. I understand with tensions today that people are rightfully upset about society, but there are other communities that allow such posts.</p>\n<p>Any questions feel free to reply to this post or DM me. Happy posting.</p>\n",
          "id": "https://lemmy2.local/post/44033550",
          "mediaType": "text/html",
          "name": "Memes and Violent Posts",
          "published": "2026-03-09T13:18:39.816036Z",
          "sensitive": false,
          "source": {
