          "audience": "https://lemmy2.local/c/pics",
          "cc": [],
          "content": "<p>I opened the door to a shed and found this guy sitting in the middle of the floor. It’s been a long time since I’ve seen one this big in the wild. My coworker said it was nice enough to be out in the open and not hiding somewhere I had to put my hands.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lemmy2.local/pictrs/image/192e3d05-c0a1-4a36-a996-505abc7785f4.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://lemmy2.local/pictrs/image/1bda0d38-c58d-477f-b8ce-dd920e9373df.jpeg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n",
