          "mediaType": "text/html",
          "name": "I had a run in with a scorpion at work the other day",
          "published": "2026-08-26T08:21:49.656168Z",
          "sensitive": false,
          "source": {
            "content": "I opened the door to a shed and found this guy sitting in the middle of the floor. It's been a long time since I've seen one this big in the wild. My coworker said it was nice enough to be out in the open and not hiding somewhere I had to put my hands. \n\n![](https://lemmy2.local/pictrs/image/192e3d05-c0a1-4a36-a996-505abc7785f4.jpeg)\n\n![](https://lemmy2.local/pictrs/image/1bda0d38-c58d-477f-b8ce-dd920e9373df.jpeg)",
